	<id>accessaudit</id>

	<name>Nextcloud Access Audit</name>

	<summary>Audit user group memberships and active file shares in Nextcloud.</summary>

	<description>
		Nextcloud Access Audit provides administrators with a centralized view of
		user group memberships and active file and folder shares.

		The application helps identify users, authentication backends, group
		memberships, internal shares, public links and other active sharing
		permissions configured within the Nextcloud instance.

		It is designed as a read-only auditing and reporting tool for Nextcloud
		administrators.
	</description>

